{"id":"79feb68fda54b2df","group":"20","path":"20/20-ex-coce-reduction-fails.md","title":"co-c.e. 类不满足 reduction principle","display":"ex-coce-reduction-fails — co-c.e. 类不满足 reduction principle","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-ex-coce-reduction-fails","aliases":["20-ex-coce-reduction-fails"],"display":"ex-coce-reduction-fails — co-c.e. 类不满足 reduction principle","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.1.21","source_printed_pages":[27],"source_pdf_pages":[63],"depends_on":["[[20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable]]","[[20-df-separator]]","[[20-thm-rec-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-ex-coce-reduction-fails"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-ex-coce-reduction-fails</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-coce-reduction-fails — co-c.e. 类不满足 reduction principle"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.1.21"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>63</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4f6ed68c536ba88e\" href=\"?note=4f6ed68c536ba88e\" title=\"20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable\">20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f5c300501e65ad4\" href=\"?note=9f5c300501e65ad4\" title=\"20-df-separator\">20-df-separator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0,A_1\">\\(A_0,A_1\\)</span> 为上游的对角不可分 c.e. 对；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\omega\\setminus A_0\">\\(X=\\omega\\setminus A_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=\\omega\\setminus A_1\">\\(Y=\\omega\\setminus A_1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f6ed68c536ba88e\" href=\"?note=4f6ed68c536ba88e\" title=\"20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable\">20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f5c300501e65ad4\" href=\"?note=9f5c300501e65ad4\" title=\"20-df-separator\">20-df-separator</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}coce\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}fails}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists U,V\\ [\\omega\\setminus U,\\omega\\setminus V\\in\\mathcal E\\land U\\subseteq X\\land V\\subseteq Y\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing\\land U\\cup V=X\\cup Y].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}coce\\text{-}reduction\\text{-}fails}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists U,V\\ [\\omega\\setminus U,\\omega\\setminus V\\in\\mathcal E\\land U\\subseteq X\\land V\\subseteq Y\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing\\land U\\cup V=X\\cup Y].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若此 U,V 存在，X∪Y=ω 给 V=Ū。两者皆 co-c.e. 且互补，因此也皆 c.e.，从而可计算。A₀⊆V⊆Ā₁，于是 V 是可计算分离集合，与对角有效不可分性矛盾。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.1.21；印刷页 27；PDF 第 63 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"